# Build context excludes for root-context images (backend, file-service).
# Never copy host node_modules into the image: they were created against the host's
# pnpm store, so `COPY . .` would leave the image's modules dir inconsistent and pnpm
# would try to purge+reinstall it (ERR_PNPM_ABORTED_REMOVE_MODULES_DIR_NO_TTY in a
# non-interactive build). The image installs its own deps in the deps/builder stage.
**/node_modules

# Build outputs / caches — regenerated inside the image
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
# TS incremental build state — MUST be excluded. The @cos/* packages put their
# tsBuildInfoFile at the package root (not in dist), and tsc with `incremental: true`
# skips emit when a stale buildinfo says "up to date". Letting a host buildinfo leak in
# via `COPY . .` makes `tsc` emit nothing → dependents fail with TS2307 on @cos/* dist.
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# VCS
.git
.gitignore

# Local env / secrets — never bake into an image (keep the template only)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Logs / OS cruft
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

# React Native native build dirs — large, never needed by backend/file-service images
apps/mobile/ios
apps/mobile/android
